It does not include third-party code. Third-party data:

- src/common-passwords.txt: passwords of 12 or more characters (lower case)
  taken from the SecLists project (Passwords/Common-Credentials),
  Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler, MIT License.
- tests/rdpgfx_unit.mjs: ZGFX sample data from the [MS-RDPEGFX]
  specification (Microsoft Open Specifications); tests/fixtures/
  gfx-vectors.txt contains the [MS-RDPEGFX] ClearCodec sample 2.
- src/Rdp/Ncrush.php, public/assets/bulk.js: NCRUSH Huffman codes and
  length/offset tables from the [MS-RDPEGDI] specification (Microsoft Open
  Specifications). tests/fixtures/ncrush-vectors.txt and xcrush-vectors.txt
  were produced with the compressors of FreeRDP (Apache License 2.0).
- src/Rdp/Ntlm.php (UPPER), tests/fixtures/windows-upcase.txt: the upper
  case that Windows 11 gives each UTF-16 code unit, read from its
  RtlUpcaseUnicodeChar (the table of the user name in NTLM).
